WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.200
[Synthesized transcription phrase: Clifford Brown]
A musician shapes a solo phrase.

00:00:05.750 --> 00:00:09.650
[Synthesized transcription phrase: Joe Henderson]
A different musician, years later.

00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:16.100
We start with a transcription.
Each note has a pitch, a beat position, and a length.

00:00:16.100 --> 00:00:23.000
We compare the steps between pitches.
Five matching steps start the search, even in another key.

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:28.000
We extend the shared run and line up the passages note by note.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:33.100
An extra note may be skipped.
Pitch and rhythm shape the similarity score.

00:00:33.750 --> 00:00:38.100
Listen to both and judge for yourself!

00:00:38.750 --> 00:00:42.000
Stolen Moments.
